  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kebbi - MatanFada Fakai Multi-Purpose Groundnut Production and Processing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Groundnuts Beneficiaries: 200 (112 women) Description: There is a growing market opportunities for MFMCG groundnut production in Zuru emirate characterised by a limited supply of groundnut oil in the market as production is mostly at the household and small-scale industrial. This shortfall is also owing to ban on imported vegetable oil and recent closure of borders to smuggling and insecurity in the country. MFMCG seek to increase production of groundnut oil to meet the local needs of Zuru and 3 surrounding LGs in the emirate.</narrative>
  </description>
